-- Chuong III, Muc 1-2 (Dieu 64-83): conditions for a licence, ownership, the licence procedure and time limits,
-- official operation, changes, revocation, representative offices, governance and officers. Law 139/2025/QH15
-- changes this part in seven places, each a dated arm: Dieu 64(1)(a) and (4) repealed (Dieu 2(7)); Dieu 69
-- repealed (Dieu 2(7)); Dieu 71(3) repealed (Dieu 2(7)); Dieu 73 replaced (Dieu 1(3)); Dieu 74(3)(b) amended
-- (Dieu 1(4)); Dieu 81 replaced (Dieu 1(5)); Dieu 82(4) and (6) amended (Dieu 1(6)).
-- Amounts are VND or US dollars as the Law writes them: "2.000 ty Dong" is 2,000 billion = 2 trillion VND; "02 ty
-- Do la My" is 2 billion US dollars. The Government fixes the minimum charter capital and minimum total assets (inputs).

§ `Chuong III, Muc 1: Giay phep thanh lap va hoat dong`

§§ `Dieu 64: general conditions for a licence`

-- Dieu 64(1). V1: (a) the right to found and manage an enterprise (Law on Enterprises); (b) an organisation
-- is a lawful legal person, and if it contributes 10% or more of charter capital it was profitable in each of
-- the latest 3 consecutive financial years and meets the Government's financial conditions; (c) a licensed
-- insurer or reinsurer founding a new one was profitable for 3 years and meets the capital adequacy ratio.
-- Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 2(7) repeals (a) from V2; the right to contribute is then Dieu 3(3).
-- src:1166 | 1. Điều kiện về cổ đông, thành viên góp vốn thành lập:
-- src:1167 | a) Tổ chức, cá nhân có quyền thành lập và quản lý doanh nghiệp tại Việt Nam
-- src:1168 | theo quy định của Luật Doanh nghiệp;
-- src:1169 | b) Tổ chức có tư cách pháp nhân, đang hoạt động hợp pháp; trường hợp tham
