-- src:1225 | Nam: có tổng tài sản không thấp hơn 2.000 tỷ Đồng Việt Nam vào năm liền kề
-- src:1226 | trước năm nộp hồ sơ đề nghị cấp giấy phép;
-- src:1227 | 3. Căn cứ quy định tại điểm d khoản 1 và khoản 2 Điều này, Chính phủ quy
-- src:1228 | định cụ thể mức tổng tài sản tối thiểu phù hợp với từng thời kỳ.
@ref Dieu 65 (src:1194-1228)
GIVEN m IS A `A member of a limited liability insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 65: the member of the limited liability insurer meets the conditions` m MEANS
        m's `is an organisation`
    AND m's `meets the general conditions of Dieu 64`
    AND (   IF m's `is established under foreign law`
            THEN     m's `is a foreign insurer, reinsurer or financial or insurance group`
                 AND m's `a foreign authority confirmed no serious breach of insurance law in the latest 3 consecutive years`
                 AND m's `has itself or through a subsidiary run the intended field for the latest 7 consecutive years`
                 AND m's `total assets in the year before the application, in US dollars` AT LEAST 2_000_000_000
                 AND m's `committed to financial, technological, governance, risk, management and operational support and to the Law's financial safety rules`
            ELSE m's `total assets in the year before the application, in Vietnamese dong` AT LEAST 2_000_000_000_000)
    AND `the member reaches the Government's minimum if one is supplied` m

GIVEN m IS A `A member of a limited liability insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the member reaches the Government's minimum if one is supplied` m MEANS
    CONSIDER m's `minimum total assets the Government specifies for the period`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST g THEN IF m's `is established under foreign law`
                      THEN m's `total assets in the year before the application, in US dollars` AT LEAST g
                      ELSE m's `total assets in the year before the application, in Vietnamese dong` AT LEAST g

