GIVEN s IS A `The shareholders of a joint stock insurer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 66: the shareholders of the joint stock insurer meet the conditions` s MEANS
        s's `number of organisation shareholders each holding 10% or more of charter capital and meeting Dieu 65` AT LEAST 2
    AND s's `largest holding of one individual as a share of charter capital` AT MOST 10%

