-- src:1276 | tại Điều 81 của Luật này.
@ref Dieu 67 (src:1245-1276)
GIVEN b IS A `A foreign branch applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 67(1)-(2): the foreign branch applicant meets the conditions` b MEANS
        b's `is a non-life insurer or a reinsurer`
    AND b's `the head office is in a country with a treaty with Vietnam allowing branches, and its regulator signed an agreement with the Ministry of Finance`
    AND b's `the home regulator allowed the branch within the lines the parent may carry on`
    AND b's `years of experience in the field intended` AT LEAST 7
    AND b's `total assets in the year before the application, in US dollars` AT LEAST 2_000_000_000
    AND b's `profitable in each of the latest 3 consecutive financial years and meets the financial conditions the Government sets`
    AND b's `undertook to guarantee and answer for all obligations of the branch`
    AND b's `capital allocated in Vietnamese dong`
    AND `the allocated capital reaches the Government's minimum` b
    AND b's `capital is lawful and not borrowed or entrusted`
    AND b's `has a branch director and an actuary expected to meet the conditions of Dieu 81`

GIVEN b IS A `A foreign branch applicant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the allocated capital reaches the Government's minimum` b MEANS
    CONSIDER b's `minimum allocated capital the Government sets`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN REFUSE "Dieu 67(2)(a) requires allocated capital not below the minimum the Government sets; no minimum is supplied"
    WHEN JUST m THEN b's `allocated capital` AT LEAST m

