@ref Dieu 79 (src:1497-1512)
GIVEN g IS A `A governance structure`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 79: the governance structure is one the Law allows` g MEANS
    IF g's `is a joint stock company`
    THEN     (   (    g's `has a general meeting of shareholders, a board and a chief executive`
                  AND g's `has a supervisory board`
                  AND g's `number of controllers on the supervisory board` AT LEAST 3
                  AND g's `number of controllers on the supervisory board` AT MOST 5)
              OR (    g's `has a general meeting of shareholders, a board and a chief executive`
                  AND (NOT g's `has a supervisory board`)
                  AND g's `number of independent board members` AT LEAST g's `number of board members` TIMES 20%
                  AND g's `has an audit committee under the board`))
    ELSE g's `has a members' council and a chief executive`

§§ `Dieu 80: officers and controllers`

