GIVEN v IS A `A vacancy`
GIVETH A DATE
`Dieu 80(4): the last day to file a valid dossier for a new chief executive or actuary` v MEANS
    v's `date the chief executive or actuary left office` PLUS 75

GIVEN v IS A `A vacancy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 80(4): the dossier was filed in time` v MEANS
    v's `date the insurer filed a valid dossier for a replacement` AT MOST `Dieu 80(4): the last day to file a valid dossier for a new chief executive or actuary` v

§§ `Dieu 81: conditions and standards for officers`

-- Dieu 81, V1 text (Dieu 81 of the Law as made): general conditions (a)-(b), then board chair and members,
-- chief executive and legal representative, other managers, controllers. V2 (Law 139/2025/QH15 Dieu 1(5)) replaces
-- the whole article: the general conditions lose "the right to manage enterprises under the Law on Enterprises"
-- (the lead-in no longer lists it); the chief executive's degree route widens to economics, finance, banking, law,
-- business administration, accounting or auditing with an insurance subject; the chief executive's 3 years as
-- manager or controller may be at "an organisation operating directly in insurance, finance or banking" instead of
-- at an insurer, reinsurer or foreign branch; the other managers' degree route widens to any field with an
-- insurance subject; V2 adds that the Minister details the degree rules (Dieu 81(5)).
-- src:1549 | 1. Điều kiện, tiêu chuẩn chung:
-- src:1550 | a) Có quyền quản lý doanh nghiệp theo quy định của Luật Doanh nghiệp;
-- src:1551 | b) Không bị xử phạt vi phạm hành chính trong lĩnh vực kinh doanh bảo hiểm,
