-- src:law139-2025-qh15:127 | các trưởng bộ phận nghiệp vụ, có ít nhất 03 năm kinh nghiệm làm việc trong lĩnh
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:128 | vực bảo hiểm hoặc lĩnh vực chuyên môn dự kiến đảm nhiệm;
-- src:law139-2025-qh15:130 | c) Cư trú tại Việt Nam trong thời gian đương nhiệm;
@ref Dieu 81 (src:1580-1595; src:law139-2025-qh15:116-130)
GIVEN c IS A `A candidate officer`
      `the manager is the head of a business department` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Dieu 81: another manager meets the conditions` c `the manager is the head of a business department` MEANS
        `Dieu 81: the general conditions are met` c
    AND (IF `the rules in force are those of V2 or later`
         THEN     c's `has a degree in insurance`
               OR c's `has a degree in another field that includes an insurance subject`
               OR c's `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate suited to the types of insurance the insurer may carry on`
         ELSE     c's `has a degree in insurance`
               OR c's `has a degree in another field and an insurance certificate suited to the types of insurance the insurer may carry on`)
    AND (IF `the manager is the head of a business department`
         THEN c's `years of experience in insurance or the intended specialty` AT LEAST 3
         ELSE c's `years of experience in insurance, finance, banking or the intended specialty` AT LEAST 3)
    AND c's `resides in Vietnam while in office`

