§ `Chuong III, Muc 3: Kiem soat noi bo, kiem toan noi bo, quan tri rui ro`

-- Dieu 84-86 set duties of internal organisation (build internal-control standards and procedures; an internal audit
-- unit that reviews the internal control every year; a risk management system with a written policy approved by the
-- board). Each is a duty whose breach is a judgement about the adequacy of a system ("hieu qua", "day du", "phu hop"),
-- with no fact a witness could testify to other than the assertion that it was done, and each delegates its detail
-- to the Minister of Finance. They are carried as labelled stubs. The one dated element, Dieu 86(3) (the annual
-- solvency and risk report), takes effect on 1 January 2028 and is listed in law08-ch7-commencement.l4.
